    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section19331230181011",
      "text": "开发者服务器调用此接口同步华为服务器的游戏资源，用于上传或下架“在玩”页面上的图片或视频。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section8202184551317",
      "text": "Resources"
    },
    {
      "section": "签名机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section16341195442212",
      "text": "为了确保HTTPS传输的安全性，防止请求参数被篡改，应用需要在调用接口时携带请求参数的签名字符串，用于华为服务器对请求参数进行校验。签名字符串的生成规则如下所示："
    },
    {
      "section": "签名机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section16341195442212",
      "text": "将请求参数Body中除sign以外的参数，按参数名首字母的ASCII码将参数升序排序。若遇到相同首字母，则比较第二个字母，以此类推。"
    },
    {
      "section": "签名机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section16341195442212",
      "text": "排序完成之后，将所有参与签名的参数值进行urlencode之后以“&”字符连接成字符串，例如“a=xxxxxx&b=xxxxxxx&c=xxxxxx”，此字符串便是待签名字符串。 Java示例代码如下： // 组装body内除sign以外的参数，此处参数值仅为示例 Map<String, String> paramsMap = new HashMap<>(); paramsMap.put(\"appId\", \"appId\"); paramsMap.put(\"reqId\", \"reqId\"); paramsMap.put(\"status\", \"1\"); paramsMap.put(\"ts\", \"111111111\"); // 对参数进行字典序排序 Map<String, String> tempMap = new TreeMap<>(params); // 拼接参数 for (Map.Entry<String, String> entry : tempMap.entrySet()) { String key = entry.getKey(); String value = entry.getValue(); base.append(key).append('=').append(null == value ? '' : URLEncoder.encode(value, \"UTF-8\")).append('&'); } if (base.length() > 0) { base.deleteCharAt(base.length() - 1); }"
    },
    {
      "section": "签名机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section16341195442212",
      "text": "// 组装body内除sign以外的参数，此处参数值仅为示例"
    },
    {
      "section": "签名机制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-resources-0000002022105725#section16341195442212",
      "text": "Map<String, String> paramsMap = new HashMap<>();"
    },
